WEBVTT

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.990 line:0%
[Episode 19]

00:01:48.279 --> 00:01:49.080 line:0%
Jing Lin!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.760 line:0%
Hasn't the doctor arrived yet?

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:52.720 line:0%
Jing Lin went to get a doctor.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.480 line:0%
It's raining too heavily.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.100 line:0%
It must have delayed them.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.200 line:0%
No.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.200 line:0%
If this continues,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.340 line:0%
he'll lose too much blood.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.080 line:0%
Butler,

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:03.440 line:0%
prepare hot water and gauze!

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:04.040 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.110 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:22.400 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.620 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:34.110 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:42.090 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.120 line:0%
These tools

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.040 line:0%
are what I use

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.720 line:0%
when dealing with the dead.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.440 line:0%
But desperate times call for desperate measures.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.500 line:0%
Please don't mind.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.550 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:53.280 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.960 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:02:59.629 --> 00:03:03.750 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.760 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:13.690 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:19.490 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:24.530 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.180 line:0%
Why is he so feverish?

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:49.470 line:0%
Butler,

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:50.050 line:0%
go check

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:50.900 line:0%
where Jing Lin is.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.160 line:0%
Let me know when he arrives.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:52.900 line:0%
Yes.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.629 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:04.400 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:10.320 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:14.890 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:20.590 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:19.870 line:0%
You saved me again.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.510 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.880 line:0%
[Lai Luofu]

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.210 line:0%
Crying is not helpful at all.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.960 line:0%
It's not helpful at all.

00:05:31.959 --> 00:05:33.770 line:0%
Huo'e can't die in vain.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.520 line:0%
Shen Du

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:40.010 line:0%
will get what he deserves.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.020 line:0%
And Huo'e

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.660 line:0%
will eventually be resurrected.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:53.700 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:52.720 line:0%
Your

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.360 line:0%
Majesties,

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.959 line:0%
overnight, Xiang'an City has been abuzz.

00:05:55.959 --> 00:05:57.160 line:0%
They say

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.600 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.360 line:0%
was publicly assassinated by Chen Huo'e

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.680 line:0%
yesterday

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.480 line:0%
and was fatally wounded.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:08.840 line:0%
Back then, Lord Lai

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.360 line:0%
said with certainty

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.570 line:0%
that Chen Huo'e had been executed.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.780 line:0%
Yet now, a high-ranking official

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.640 line:0%
was severely wounded in front of the people

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.370 line:0%
by someone supposed to be dead.

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.040 line:0%
This isn't just a failure

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.840 line:0%
in the investigation and trial.

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:22.880 line:0%
It's a slap

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.720 line:0%
in the face of Cang State!

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:26.760 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.720 line:0%
everyone knows that Lord Lai

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.610 line:0%
is loyal to Cang State.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:34.150 line:0%
And the Imperial Investigation Department has always been strict and efficient.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.110 line:0%
All this time,

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:36.440 line:0%
it's been the pillar

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.740 line:0%
of Cang State's authority.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.700 line:0%
Lord Lai is

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.780 line:0%
the Black Rakshasa that everyone fears.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.350 line:0%
As for the Imperial Investigation Department, once someone is taken there,

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.760 line:0%
no one has ever dared to disobey.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.920 line:0%
But Chen Huo'e

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.800 line:0%
has escaped from the Imperial Investigation Department multiple times.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.400 line:0%
I can't help but suspect

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.620 line:0%
whether Lord Lai

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.580 line:0%
is incompetent

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.330 line:0%
or complicit in it.

00:06:58.459 --> 00:06:59.880 line:0%
Your Majesty, please be clear.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:01.320 line:0%
Chen Huo'e indeed died under torture and interrogation

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.840 line:0%
in the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:03.520 line:0%
The case file

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.000 line:0%
and Chen Huo'e's confession and belongings

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.660 line:0%
have all been submitted by me.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.320 line:0%
But I heard

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.520 line:0%
although Chen Huo'e was beheaded,

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.640 line:0%
she still had the ability to resurrect.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.300 line:0%
The people have spread rumors

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.960 line:0%
that one day, Chen Huo'e

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.260 line:0%
will return.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.920 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.640 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:22.920 line:0%
take it out.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.240 line:0%
Shen Du, the Imperial Security Bureau's grand commander, humbly reports:

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:32.120 line:0%
I have discovered that Chen Huo'e

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.630 line:0%
is a rare mirror-image person.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.230 line:0%
She was captured and beheaded on the spot.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.160 line:0%
There will be no more Chen Huo'e in this world.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.760 line:0%
A mirror-image person?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.380 line:0%
Is this

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.680 line:0%
the secret behind

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.120 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's repeated escapes in the past?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.890 line:0%
Lord Lai, you interrogated her personally,

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:51.959 line:0%
but you didn't notice the anomaly

00:07:51.959 --> 00:07:54.360 line:0%
of Chen Huo'e being a mirror-image person?

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.540 line:0%
It was my dereliction of duty.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.400 line:0%
Was it dereliction of duty

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.720 line:0%
or did you think

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.880 line:0%
it was unnecessary to report to me?

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:11.740 line:0%
I dare not.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:13.600 line:0%
I would never

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.400 line:0%
dare hide anything

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.920 line:0%
from you, Your Majesty!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.430 line:0%
It seems

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.950 line:0%
the pillar of Cang State's authority

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.580 line:0%
should be changed.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:26.400 line:0%
Lord Lai, you let a tiger return to the mountain.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.360 line:0%
Although it was unintentional,

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.600 line:0%
you committed the crime of negligence.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.160 line:0%
You are fined one year's salary.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.709 line:0%
And disband

00:08:33.709 --> 00:08:34.959 line:0%
your ostentatious

00:08:35.729 --> 00:08:36.890 line:0%
entourage.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.140 line:0%
Thank you for your mercy, Your Majesty.

00:08:43.349 --> 00:08:44.620 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.000 line:0%
send the best imperial doctors

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:48.440 line:0%
and use the best medicine.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.560 line:0%
Make sure Mr. Shen recovers as soon as possible.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.000 line:0%
Yes.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.060 line:0%
He made such a big mistake,

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:02.980 line:0%
but he was only fined a year's salary.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.400 line:0%
Mother is truly lenient

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:05.600 line:0%
towards Lord Lai.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.600 line:0%
Your Highness, since you have objection,

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.280 line:0%
why didn't you

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.940 line:0%
raise it in the court earlier?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.320 line:0%
What do you mean, Minister Zhang?

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.250 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:16.920 line:0%
Sister.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.640 line:0%
Chen Huo'e committed heinous crimes.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.240 line:0%
Mother has her own judgment.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.080 line:0%
It's best not to

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.410 line:0%
discuss it rashly here.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.580 line:0%
What Prince Xian said is right.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.990 line:0%
I was too careless.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.490 line:0%
You always try to be the good guy.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.030 line:0%
You've lost so much blood.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.850 line:0%
And you had a high fever last night.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.210 line:0%
Please, you must wake up.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:45.480 line:0%
I haven't cleared

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.160 line:0%
the Shen family's name yet.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.420 line:0%
♫My heart burned, leaving me cold and forlorn♫

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.110 line:0%
♫And a lifetime of loneliness♫

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.620 line:0%
♫My love blazed. Where did it scatter♫

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.080 line:0%
♫And where did it leave its marks?♫

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:15.510 line:0%
♫Drifting through the mist♫

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:20.200 line:0%
♫Amidst the vast, endless waves, I searched in the darkness♫

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:19.940 line:0%
Why are you here again?

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.400 line:0%
If you're caught, you'll die.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.960 line:0%
I promised to bring you

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:25.310 line:0%
♫You passed by, igniting fireworks♫

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.980 line:0%
the cuju balls from the West Market.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.200 line:0%
When I came in,

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.650 line:0%
they got a bit squashed,

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:33.020 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:30.450 line:0%
but they should taste good.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.140 line:0%
Try them.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:39.810 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:45.660 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.680 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.560 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.040 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:01.830 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.100 line:0%
I don't have any money on me.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.150 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.710 line:0%
I'll give you this instead.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.380 line:0%
I don't want your money.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:09.040 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.000 line:0%
Do you take me as an errand girl delivering dishes?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.680 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.790 line:0%
No, I...

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.280 line:0%
This whistle was given to me by my father.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:17.600 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.240 line:0%
Look.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.710 line:0%
There's a Shen character on it.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:22.520 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.610 line:0%
[Shen]

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.590 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:28.890 line:0%
I should leave.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:29.900 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.360 line:0%
Otherwise, they'll come to catch me again.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.710 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.010 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.560 line:0%
Will you come again?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.110 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:40.760 line:0%
Of course.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.080 line:0%
One day,

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.000 line:0%
I will clear the Shen family's name

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:45.060 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.110 line:0%
and get you out of here aboveboard.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:51.340 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.100 line:0%
You survived

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.000 line:0%
the hardest days

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.460 line:0%
in the Prisoner's Center.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:12:59.600 line:0%
This time,

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.320 line:0%
you can surely

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.520 line:0%
survive too.

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.020 line:0%
So it really was you.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.080 line:0%
You can do it.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.970 line:0%
You can do it.

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.130 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.680 line:0%
even though you're sick,

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:26.810 line:0%
you should stay spirited

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.990 line:0%
and wear cool clothes.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:30.190 line:0%
Maybe

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.500 line:0%
you can recover faster.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.040 line:0%
Thank goodness it was you.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.840 line:0%
I've stitched up the wounds.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.240 line:0%
Lying here,

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.320 line:0%
he's no different

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.580 line:0%
from any other corpse.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.440 line:0%
I've dissected so many male bodies.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.300 line:0%
Why would I feel embarrassed to change his clothes?

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:55.110 line:0%
[How magnanimous and gentle is he! There he is in his chariot with its two high sides. Skillful is he at quips and jokes, but how does he keep from rudeness in them!]

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:55.110 line:0%
[Look at those recesses in the banks of the Qi. With their green bamboos, so dense together. There is our elegant and accomplished prince, pure as gold or as tin, soft and rich as a scepter of jade.]

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.480 line:0%
Every night, he placed this rattan-woven pig

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:04.760 line:0%
under his pillow.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.380 line:0%
[How magnanimous and gentle is he! There he is in his chariot with its two high sides. Skillful is he at quips and jokes, but how does he keep from rudeness in them!]

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.380 line:0%
[Look at those recesses in the banks of the Qi. With their green bamboos, so dense together. There is our elegant and accomplished prince, pure as gold or as tin, soft and rich as a scepter of jade.]

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:07.920 line:0%
The handwriting on the letter is delicate.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:08.760 line:0%
It must

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:10.640 line:0%
be from

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.200 line:0%
the woman he can't forget.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.620 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.350 line:0%
I won't pester you.

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:23.790 line:0%
You saved me,

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.840 line:0%
and I've been taking care of you.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:29.170 line:0%
We're even.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.850 line:0%
When the three-month period ends,

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.290 line:0%
I'll divorce you as agreed.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:45.350 line:0%
Three months?

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:48.840 line:0%
Divorce as agreed?

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.840 line:0%
What did I just hear?

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.660 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:53.710 line:0%
Xing.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.720 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:00.080 line:0%
With such a big incident,

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.360 line:0%
how could I not come?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.760 line:0%
Since this morning's court session,

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.240 line:0%
the six ministries have been abuzz.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:05.960 line:0%
They say the White Ghost

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.890 line:0%
was fatally injured by Chen Huo'e.

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.750 line:0%
Is he about to die?

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.560 line:0%
He is severely injured,

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:13.400 line:0%
but...

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.440 line:0%
But what?

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.760 line:0%
I'm so anxious!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:16.880 line:0%
Xing,

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.340 line:0%
what exactly happened between you and the White Ghost?

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.520 line:0%
Nothing.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.400 line:0%
At a time like this,

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:25.200 line:0%
you still want to hide it from me?

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.920 line:0%
You two... are a fake couple?

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.830 line:0%
Chuichui, you must keep this a secret for me.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.680 line:0%
I had no choice.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.740 line:0%
Did Shen Du threaten you?

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.750 line:0%
He must have.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.680 line:0%
Three months?

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.410 line:0%
Then you can escape

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:47.700 line:0%
from the White Ghost's lair, right?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.600 line:0%
That's a good thing too.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:53.580 line:0%
But...

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.740 line:0%
given his current condition,

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:56.640 line:0%
what if he can't

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:57.960 line:0%
wake up in three months?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:58.800 line:0%
Impossible.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.200 line:0%
He will wake up.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.280 line:0%
But what if he

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:01.880 line:0%
can't wake up?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.160 line:0%
Will you just keep watching over him forever?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.149 line:0%
He ended up like this

00:17:04.149 --> 00:17:06.389 line:0%
-in order to save me.
-Yes, I know.

00:17:06.389 --> 00:17:06.960 line:0%
But you should also

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.240 line:0%
think for yourself.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:09.950 line:0%
What if...

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:12.629 line:0%
he...

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.080 line:0%
well...

00:17:14.629 --> 00:17:16.280 line:0%
will you live as his widow?

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:16.960 line:0%
Stop!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:17.600 line:0%
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.280 line:0%
-knock on wood.
-knock on wood.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.320 line:0%
Since you two are a fake couple,

00:17:21.389 --> 00:17:23.050 line:0%
no matter what happens to him,

00:17:23.389 --> 00:17:25.590 line:0%
you should think about your own future.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.460 line:0%
Think about it.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.480 line:0%
When you return to Yan's Mansion in the future,

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.770 line:0%
if you're a divorced woman,

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.730 line:0%
would First Madam

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.030 line:0%
and your siblings

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.680 line:0%
still treat you well?

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.040 line:0%
You and Ms. Jin

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:38.880 line:0%
would face endless

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.700 line:0%
judgment and exclusion.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:42.870 line:0%
I think you'd better

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.080 line:0%
find a good man to remarry.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.400 line:0%
Well, Chuichui,

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.720 line:0%
what are you talking about?

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.120 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.680 line:0%
But I don't think in the Ministry of Justice,

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.610 line:0%
there is any good man left to marry.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.760 line:0%
Jiang Langxing.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.000 line:0%
Why don't you consider Jiang Langxing?

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.180 line:0%
Jiang Langxing

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.670 line:0%
always

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.950 line:0%
pulls a long face

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.370 line:0%
and is rigid,

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.320 line:0%
but he is indeed a good person.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.640 line:0%
He is quite adorable sometimes.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.440 line:0%
He's not bad.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:18.040 line:0%
You want me to develop a relationship with Jiang Langxing?

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:18.960 line:0%
Isn't he good?

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:22.640 line:0%
Fine.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.430 line:0%
Let me think harder.

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:27.600 line:0%
I've thought of someone

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.080 line:0%
more suitable.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.180 line:0%
Constable Marshal.

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:34.470 line:0%
Commander Xu

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.010 line:0%
has a humble background,

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:39.190 line:0%
but he's tall and strong.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.780 line:0%
And he is generous.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.560 line:0%
Even if you can't

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.200 line:0%
be the first madam of the Shen family,

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.840 line:0%
being Constable Marshal's wife

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.950 line:0%
would still be impressive.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.310 line:0%
Xu is a good man,

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.120 line:0%
but he and I

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.430 line:0%
don't have any romantic relationship.

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:53.360 line:0%
Chuichui, please stop

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.440 line:0%
playing the role of a matchmaker.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.340 line:0%
A romantic relationship can be cultivated.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.680 line:0%
Commander Xu

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:58.930 line:0%
looks like the type

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.360 line:0%
who'd dote on his wife.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.920 line:0%
That would be great.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.720 line:0%
Isn't it better than

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:04.560 line:0%
being with the White Ghost

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:05.900 line:0%
who always angers you?

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.780 line:0%
I'm just injured,

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.110 line:0%
not dead.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.520 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.880 line:0%
-you're awake!
-You're awake!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:18.680 line:0%
Be careful.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.560 line:0%
Be careful.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:20.860 line:0%
Lu Chuichui,

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.480 line:0%
who are you to talk nonsense

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.720 line:0%
in my mansion?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.130 line:0%
Get out!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:36.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.750 line:0%
-I'll wait for you outside.
-You…

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:42.310 line:0%
Be careful.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.100 line:0%
When...

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.020 line:0%
did you wake up?

00:19:59.040 --> 00:19:59.840 line:0%
Just now.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.400 line:0%
Just now?

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.260 line:0%
Just now, you...

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:06.840 line:0%
suddenly...

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.480 line:0%
Just now, I

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:08.600 line:0%
suddenly woke up.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.050 line:0%
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:36.590 line:0%
If it weren't for you,

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.360 line:0%
I would have been killed

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.840 line:0%
by Chen Huo'e.

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:43.360 line:0%
And you got so badly injured because of me.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.900 line:0%
Chen Huo'e was the one to blame,

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.400 line:0%
not you.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:56.390 line:0%
You're the one

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.870 line:0%
who treated my wounds, right?

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.100 line:0%
Where is Chen Huo'e's body?

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.520 line:0%
You were injured at that time.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:15.100 line:0%
Jing Lin and I were in a hurry to bring you back.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.510 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's body

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:18.360 line:0%
was secretly taken away.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.980 line:0%
Jing Lin started investigating it immediately.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:22.080 line:0%
He thinks it was someone from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.720 line:0%
who took her body away.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.210 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:29.840 line:0%
I'm thinking about this.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.400 line:0%
Chen Huo'e went missing before.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.600 line:0%
It was Lai Luozhi's dereliction of duty.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.960 line:0%
Now someone from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:36.400 line:0%
has stolen

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.000 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's body.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.040 line:0%
They must be up to something.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.520 line:0%
We might as well wait for now,

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:43.880 line:0%
stay still to counter their moves,

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.080 line:0%
and see what they'll do.

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:05.340 line:0%
Get some rest.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.040 line:0%
Butler,

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:38.870 line:0%
Grand Commander has woken up.

00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:40.440 line:0%
Go invite the doctor to come and check on him again.

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:41.960 line:0%
Master is awake?

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:43.680 line:0%
Thank God!

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:44.840 line:0%
God bless him!

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:47.120 line:0%
Hurry! Go invite the doctor here!

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:02.000 line:0%
Xing.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.880 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:06.080 line:0%
You finally came out.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:07.000 line:0%
Go discipline

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.360 line:0%
the servants in Shen's Mansion.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.760 line:0%
Their madam's good friend is here,

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:11.480 line:0%
but they haven't even offered a meal.

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:12.840 line:0%
Lady Lu,

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:15.010 line:0%
are you short of money?

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:18.490 line:0%
You have no idea

00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:19.800 line:0%
how good the new play

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:21.280 line:0%
at Furong Garden is.

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:24.070 line:0%
The performers were impressive,

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:26.020 line:0%
so I...

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:30.050 line:0%
tipped them with my pocket money.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.160 line:0%
And my father has stopped

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.360 line:0%
giving me pocket money.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:36.280 line:0%
And I haven't received this month's salary.

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:37.840 line:0%
So...

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:41.000 line:0%
We're good friends.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:42.930 line:0%
Just tell me if you're going to treat me to a meal or not.

00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:44.260 line:0%
I can't believe you.

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:46.600 line:0%
Butler Shen.

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:48.240 line:0%
Coming.

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:51.240 line:0%
Madam, what can I do for you?

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.520 line:0%
Please prepare a meal

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:53.440 line:0%
for Chuichui

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:55.000 line:0%
and Miss Yun Que.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.280 line:0%
Also, prepare a meal box.

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:57.320 line:0%
I'll take it to the main chamber.

00:23:57.320 --> 00:23:58.080 line:0%
Okay.

00:23:58.120 --> 00:23:59.360 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:01.520 line:0%
We rarely get to eat together.

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:03.400 line:0%
Aren't you going to eat with me?

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:04.920 line:0%
Shen Du is injured and bedridden.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.480 line:0%
He just woke up and needs someone to take care of him.

00:24:06.480 --> 00:24:08.240 line:0%
There are so many people in Shen's Mansion.

00:24:08.240 --> 00:24:10.240 line:0%
Surely they can manage without you.

00:24:26.600 --> 00:24:27.930 line:0%
Yun Que,

00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:29.560 line:0%
didn't you say

00:24:29.560 --> 00:24:31.220 line:0%
you want to marry the White...

00:24:32.680 --> 00:24:34.900 line:0%
Shen... Shen Du?

00:24:34.960 --> 00:24:36.480 line:0%
Shen Du is seriously injured.

00:24:36.480 --> 00:24:38.070 line:0%
Why haven't you gone to show your care?

00:24:38.070 --> 00:24:40.130 line:0%
Instead, you're here doing nothing.

00:24:45.800 --> 00:24:46.940 line:0%
I've seen through him.

00:24:46.940 --> 00:24:47.980 line:0%
Seen through him?

00:24:49.090 --> 00:24:50.130 line:0%
Seen through him?

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:52.640 line:0%
The White Ghost is not a good person?

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:54.210 line:0%
He's not a good husband?

00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:55.440 line:0%
But during this time,

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:57.080 line:0%
I've realized one thing.

00:24:57.480 --> 00:24:58.400 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:24:58.480 --> 00:24:59.840 line:0%
since you don't want to be Mrs. Shen,

00:24:59.840 --> 00:25:01.890 line:0%
why do you have to waste your life in Shen's Mansion?

00:25:01.890 --> 00:25:02.810 line:0%
Well said!

00:25:04.440 --> 00:25:05.240 line:0%
You two are still

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:06.240 line:0%
in Shen's Mansion.

00:25:06.240 --> 00:25:07.560 line:0%
Keep your voices down.

00:25:13.040 --> 00:25:13.840 line:0%
Madam,

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:15.850 line:0%
the food you asked for is ready.

00:25:42.250 --> 00:25:43.270 line:0%
Anyone here?

00:25:46.160 --> 00:25:46.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:48.960 line:0%
Pass my order.

00:25:49.280 --> 00:25:51.280 line:0%
Since they've all entered the game,

00:25:51.760 --> 00:25:53.200 line:0%
let's give them...

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.410 line:0%
something extra.

00:26:10.530 --> 00:26:11.770 line:0%
Right?

00:26:14.130 --> 00:26:15.240 line:0%
Listen,

00:26:15.240 --> 00:26:18.150 line:0%
he really is very handsome.

00:26:19.480 --> 00:26:21.410 line:0%
You're absolutely right.

00:26:22.920 --> 00:26:24.980 line:0%
You two just had a meal together.

00:26:25.080 --> 00:26:25.960 line:0%
And now you

00:26:25.960 --> 00:26:28.220 line:0%
have become so close?

00:26:28.560 --> 00:26:31.560 line:0%
Yun Que and I hit it off immediately.

00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:32.920 line:0%
It's like we've known each other forever.

00:26:32.920 --> 00:26:34.380 line:0%
We're as close as sisters.

00:26:34.560 --> 00:26:36.280 line:0%
Chuichui and I both believe

00:26:36.280 --> 00:26:38.320 line:0%
only women truly understand women.

00:26:38.320 --> 00:26:39.280 line:0%
Our fate

00:26:39.280 --> 00:26:40.840 line:0%
shouldn't be decided by others.

00:26:40.840 --> 00:26:41.600 line:0%
Exactly.

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:42.320 line:0%
We should

00:26:42.320 --> 00:26:44.680 line:0%
find our own path forward.

00:26:44.680 --> 00:26:45.440 line:0%
So,

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:46.800 line:0%
we've decided

00:26:46.840 --> 00:26:47.760 line:0%
to invite you

00:26:47.800 --> 00:26:48.680 line:0%
to go to Mingsheng Temple

00:26:48.680 --> 00:26:51.640 line:0%
to pray for a good marriage in three days.

00:26:51.640 --> 00:26:52.680 line:0%
Go to Mingsheng Temple

00:26:52.680 --> 00:26:54.210 line:0%
to pray for a good marriage?

00:26:55.330 --> 00:26:57.930 line:0%
You don't really want to

00:26:57.960 --> 00:27:00.420 line:0%
be Mrs. Shen for the rest of your life, do you?

00:27:00.580 --> 00:27:01.580 line:0%
Although I'm no longer

00:27:01.580 --> 00:27:02.720 line:0%
interested in Shen Du,

00:27:02.720 --> 00:27:03.600 line:0%
are you and Shen Du

00:27:03.600 --> 00:27:05.500 line:0%
really such a perfect couple?

00:27:06.640 --> 00:27:08.930 line:0%
Is the three-month agreement no longer valid?

00:27:08.930 --> 00:27:10.290 line:0%
Of course it is.

00:27:10.890 --> 00:27:12.490 line:0%
Then why are you being so coy?

00:27:15.420 --> 00:27:17.160 line:0%
Don't tell me...

00:27:17.280 --> 00:27:19.680 line:0%
you've fallen in love with the White Ghost.

00:27:26.080 --> 00:27:28.070 line:0%
When the agreed time comes,

00:27:28.100 --> 00:27:29.930 line:0%
I will naturally leave him.

00:27:31.890 --> 00:27:33.790 line:0%
I'm just focused on my career,

00:27:33.920 --> 00:27:36.800 line:0%
and I haven't thought about remarrying, that's all.

00:27:36.800 --> 00:27:38.920 line:0%
Marriage and career aren't mutually exclusive.

00:27:38.920 --> 00:27:39.880 line:0%
That's right.

00:27:40.320 --> 00:27:41.280 line:0%
In three days,

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:42.800 line:0%
we'll go to Mingsheng Temple to pray

00:27:42.800 --> 00:27:44.320 line:0%
for a good marriage first, then we'll see.

00:27:44.320 --> 00:27:45.120 line:0%
It's settled.

00:27:46.520 --> 00:27:47.120 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:27:47.260 --> 00:27:47.920 line:0%
In my room,

00:27:47.920 --> 00:27:49.280 line:0%
there are some newly pickled fruits.

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:50.200 line:0%
I haven't been able to eat much lately.

00:27:50.200 --> 00:27:51.300 line:0%
Would you like to try some?

00:27:51.300 --> 00:27:52.320 line:0%
I'd love to.

00:27:52.400 --> 00:27:53.600 line:0%
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:27:54.230 --> 00:27:54.880 line:0%
I'm leaving.

00:27:54.880 --> 00:27:56.140 line:0%
Don't miss me too much.

00:29:07.010 --> 00:29:08.410 line:0%
You take it so seriously.

00:29:09.470 --> 00:29:11.270 line:0%
Do you want me to help you choose?

00:29:17.500 --> 00:29:18.160 line:0%
What?

00:29:18.900 --> 00:29:20.700 line:0%
Do you want me to help you choose?

00:29:30.040 --> 00:29:30.840 line:0%
Indeed.

00:29:31.410 --> 00:29:33.250 line:0%
You're seriously injured.

00:29:33.430 --> 00:29:36.830 line:0%
It's indeed inappropriate for me to leave you here and go out.

00:29:38.280 --> 00:29:39.200 line:0%
Later, I'll

00:29:39.280 --> 00:29:40.360 line:0%
deliver those dresses

00:29:40.360 --> 00:29:41.360 line:0%
to Chuichui

00:29:41.360 --> 00:29:42.730 line:0%
and let her choose herself.

00:29:42.730 --> 00:29:44.880 line:0%
I won't go with them in three days.

00:29:45.480 --> 00:29:47.740 line:0%
You're choosing a dress for Lu Chuichui?

00:29:48.520 --> 00:29:49.320 line:0%
Yes.

00:29:49.710 --> 00:29:52.000 line:0%
She's temporarily staying in Shen's Mansion these days.

00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:52.800 line:0%
It's just that

00:29:53.480 --> 00:29:54.520 line:0%
the colors of my dresses

00:29:54.520 --> 00:29:55.780 line:0%
aren't bright enough.

00:29:56.200 --> 00:29:57.930 line:0%
I'm afraid she won't like them.

00:30:01.360 --> 00:30:03.360 line:0%
Since it's an outing among sisters,

00:30:03.960 --> 00:30:05.760 line:0%
you don't need to worry about me.

00:30:06.100 --> 00:30:08.360 line:0%
Shen's Mansion isn't short of manpower.

00:30:09.090 --> 00:30:10.600 line:0%
In three days,

00:30:12.680 --> 00:30:14.480 line:0%
I should be able to get out of bed.

00:30:14.680 --> 00:30:15.880 line:0%
By that time, I'll join you...

00:30:15.880 --> 00:30:16.760 line:0%
No need for that.

00:30:16.760 --> 00:30:18.040 line:0%
You're seriously injured.

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:19.480 line:0%
You should spend more time recovering.

00:30:19.480 --> 00:30:20.560 line:0%
Get some rest.

00:31:18.320 --> 00:31:19.000 line:0%
I just

00:31:19.000 --> 00:31:20.440 line:0%
watched a couple more plays.

00:31:20.440 --> 00:31:21.920 line:0%
How did I fall asleep?

00:31:24.020 --> 00:31:24.960 line:0%
It must be because

00:31:24.960 --> 00:31:26.360 line:0%
the play was so good

00:31:26.390 --> 00:31:27.150 line:0%
that

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:28.190 line:0%
I...

00:31:30.500 --> 00:31:31.950 line:0%
It's fine.

00:31:32.320 --> 00:31:33.160 line:0%
It's okay.

00:31:36.440 --> 00:31:37.850 line:0%
Today is truly

00:31:37.890 --> 00:31:39.170 line:0%
a bright

00:31:39.590 --> 00:31:41.340 line:0%
and sunny day.

00:31:52.420 --> 00:31:53.540 line:0%
Oh no!

00:31:59.280 --> 00:32:00.980 line:0%
Are you a human or a ghost?

00:32:01.130 --> 00:32:02.080 line:0%
A ghost.

00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:06.020 line:0%
What's so scary about ghosts?

00:32:06.160 --> 00:32:08.560 line:0%
They were humans when alive.

00:32:08.620 --> 00:32:11.280 line:0%
You may not be afraid of them, but I am.

00:32:12.670 --> 00:32:14.530 line:0%
I'm terrified if you're a ghost.

00:32:15.180 --> 00:32:16.690 line:0%
Every grievance has its source, and every debt has its debtor.

00:32:16.690 --> 00:32:18.810 line:0%
Go find whoever owes you.

00:32:18.830 --> 00:32:20.060 line:0%
Please go away.

00:32:20.080 --> 00:32:21.400 line:0%
Please go away!

00:32:21.440 --> 00:32:23.130 line:0%
Back in the graveyard,

00:32:23.720 --> 00:32:25.050 line:0%
how come I didn't notice

00:32:25.120 --> 00:32:26.490 line:0%
you're so timid?

00:32:30.240 --> 00:32:31.490 line:0%
It's you.

00:32:37.420 --> 00:32:38.490 line:0%
Ghost Face,

00:32:38.640 --> 00:32:39.870 line:0%
this is so strange.

00:32:39.910 --> 00:32:41.950 line:0%
I was so scared just a moment ago,

00:32:42.470 --> 00:32:44.280 line:0%
but when you sat down next to me,

00:32:44.350 --> 00:32:45.640 line:0%
it seems this place

00:32:45.640 --> 00:32:47.240 line:0%
suddenly became less scary.

00:32:47.320 --> 00:32:48.240 line:0%
Maybe because

00:32:49.160 --> 00:32:51.230 line:0%
the ghosts here are afraid of me.

00:32:51.650 --> 00:32:53.510 line:0%
Why are you belittling yourself?

00:32:54.530 --> 00:32:55.610 line:0%
It's the fact.

00:32:56.970 --> 00:32:57.960 line:0%
In this world,

00:32:58.270 --> 00:32:59.550 line:0%
even ghosts, demons,

00:33:00.150 --> 00:33:01.730 line:0%
and monsters are afraid to

00:33:02.390 --> 00:33:04.520 line:0%
cross paths with me, let alone humans.

00:33:05.040 --> 00:33:06.290 line:0%
That's nonsense.

00:33:06.410 --> 00:33:08.410 line:0%
Why are you making it sound so scary?

00:33:08.660 --> 00:33:10.190 line:0%
You're actually very nice.

00:33:12.640 --> 00:33:13.590 line:0%
Look,

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:15.060 line:0%
it's like

00:33:15.160 --> 00:33:16.200 line:0%
in this void,

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:18.000 line:0%
even the invisible Little Fairy

00:33:18.120 --> 00:33:20.040 line:0%
wants to be friends with you.

00:33:20.560 --> 00:33:22.560 line:0%
If you don't believe me, watch this.

00:33:23.930 --> 00:33:24.950 line:0%
Pay attention.

00:33:37.080 --> 00:33:39.000 line:0%
Little Fairy, Little Fairy,

00:33:39.230 --> 00:33:40.780 line:0%
do you want to be friends

00:33:40.810 --> 00:33:41.970 line:0%
with Ghost Face?

00:33:43.690 --> 00:33:45.280 line:0%
If you do,

00:33:45.370 --> 00:33:46.680 line:0%
jump from this bowl

00:33:46.680 --> 00:33:47.920 line:0%
to this bowl.

00:33:47.940 --> 00:33:48.960 line:0%
Okay?

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:52.800 line:0%
You want Ghost Face

00:33:52.800 --> 00:33:54.260 line:0%
to personally invite you?

00:33:55.160 --> 00:33:55.960 line:0%
Ghost Face,

00:33:55.960 --> 00:33:56.760 line:0%
please invite

00:33:56.760 --> 00:33:57.640 line:0%
our Little Fairy.

00:33:57.640 --> 00:33:59.300 line:0%
Please join us, Little Fairy.

00:34:11.080 --> 00:34:11.880 line:0%
Look,

00:34:11.900 --> 00:34:13.300 line:0%
Little Fairy has agreed.

00:34:19.439 --> 00:34:20.400 line:0%
Even Little Fairy is willing

00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:21.380 line:0%
to be friends with you

00:34:21.380 --> 00:34:22.850 line:0%
and play games with you.

00:34:22.880 --> 00:34:24.700 line:0%
You're the most likable.

00:34:24.729 --> 00:34:26.870 line:0%
Everyone will like you.

00:34:28.720 --> 00:34:29.510 line:0%
Alright,

00:34:29.510 --> 00:34:30.870 line:0%
stop crying.

00:34:31.620 --> 00:34:33.310 line:0%
[Bi Luo]

00:34:31.680 --> 00:34:33.640 line:0%
You're the most likable.

00:34:34.209 --> 00:34:36.019 line:0%
Everyone will like you.

00:34:37.360 --> 00:34:40.090 line:0%
And they have to like you.

00:34:50.430 --> 00:34:51.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:34:53.360 --> 00:34:54.170 line:0%
Little Fairy,

00:34:54.600 --> 00:34:55.280 line:0%
since you're also

00:34:55.280 --> 00:34:56.539 line:0%
Lu Chuichui's friend,

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:58.510 line:0%
can you do me a favor?

00:35:02.030 --> 00:35:03.430 line:0%
Little Fairy has agreed.

00:35:32.200 --> 00:35:33.140 line:0%
What?

00:35:33.780 --> 00:35:34.740 line:0%
Are you scared?

00:35:37.440 --> 00:35:38.240 line:0%
You're

00:35:38.450 --> 00:35:39.770 line:0%
so strange.

00:35:40.090 --> 00:35:41.890 line:0%
You were not scared in the graveyard at midnight,

00:35:41.890 --> 00:35:43.810 line:0%
yet you can be so easily frightened.

00:35:43.810 --> 00:35:45.980 line:0%
I'd say you're timid and afraid of ghosts,

00:35:45.980 --> 00:35:48.550 line:0%
but you're not afraid of my ghost face.

00:35:48.900 --> 00:35:50.740 line:0%
Why should I be scared in the graveyard?

00:35:50.740 --> 00:35:53.220 line:0%
The one lying in that grave is my dearest,

00:35:53.240 --> 00:35:54.840 line:0%
most longed-for mother.

00:35:54.990 --> 00:35:56.590 line:0%
As for you, Ghost Face,

00:35:56.760 --> 00:35:58.400 line:0%
you're unwilling to remove your mask

00:35:58.400 --> 00:36:00.120 line:0%
just because of the birthmark on your face.

00:36:00.120 --> 00:36:01.860 line:0%
That's nothing to be afraid of either.

00:36:01.860 --> 00:36:02.660 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:36:02.810 --> 00:36:04.160 line:0%
I also heard

00:36:04.450 --> 00:36:06.000 line:0%
the method of using a gold ring

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:07.700 line:0%
to remove a birthmark

00:36:07.800 --> 00:36:09.370 line:0%
doesn't seem to be very effective.

00:36:09.370 --> 00:36:10.970 line:0%
Maybe you shouldn't do that.

00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:12.080 line:0%
If it scratches your face,

00:36:12.080 --> 00:36:13.210 line:0%
it wouldn't be good.

00:36:13.600 --> 00:36:14.400 line:0%
What?

00:36:15.490 --> 00:36:17.420 line:0%
You want to take the gold ring back?

00:36:18.610 --> 00:36:19.660 line:0%
You keep it.

00:36:20.300 --> 00:36:22.880 line:0%
If I can't remove the birthmark,

00:36:23.360 --> 00:36:25.120 line:0%
I'll never dare to show

00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:27.520 line:0%
my true face in front of you.

00:36:27.520 --> 00:36:28.520 line:0%
How could that be?

00:36:28.700 --> 00:36:30.760 line:0%
Having a birthmark isn't your fault.

00:36:30.760 --> 00:36:32.960 line:0%
And one's appearance

00:36:32.960 --> 00:36:33.720 line:0%
shouldn't affect

00:36:33.720 --> 00:36:35.450 line:0%
the beauty of one's inner self.

00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:37.040 line:0%
I think

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:38.460 line:0%
a person's appearance

00:36:38.720 --> 00:36:40.120 line:0%
is like

00:36:40.280 --> 00:36:41.280 line:0%
the makeup

00:36:41.280 --> 00:36:43.120 line:0%
of a traditional opera role.

00:36:44.360 --> 00:36:46.120 line:0%
It's just a part of the role.

00:36:49.840 --> 00:36:51.970 line:0%
So, what do you think of my appearance?

00:36:52.530 --> 00:36:53.320 line:0%
Is it good

00:36:54.150 --> 00:36:54.950 line:0%
or evil?

00:36:55.210 --> 00:36:56.470 line:0%
Loyal or treacherous?

00:37:05.740 --> 00:37:06.640 line:0%
When you're ready

00:37:06.640 --> 00:37:07.480 line:0%
to take off your mask,

00:37:07.480 --> 00:37:08.670 line:0%
I'll tell you.

00:37:14.640 --> 00:37:15.440 line:0%
If...

00:37:16.800 --> 00:37:18.330 line:0%
If I take off my mask,

00:37:19.020 --> 00:37:20.720 line:0%
but you don't want to look at me,

00:37:20.720 --> 00:37:21.830 line:0%
what then?

00:37:22.280 --> 00:37:23.720 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:25.620 line:0%
Indeed, I gave you that gold ring

00:37:25.620 --> 00:37:28.010 line:0%
because I hoped you could remove your birthmark.

00:37:28.010 --> 00:37:29.240 line:0%
But whether you can remove it or not

00:37:29.240 --> 00:37:30.640 line:0%
doesn't matter anymore.

00:37:30.720 --> 00:37:32.120 line:0%
Because I've already

00:37:32.120 --> 00:37:33.660 line:0%
considered you a friend.

00:37:33.910 --> 00:37:36.570 line:0%
I certainly won't judge you by your appearance.

00:37:40.360 --> 00:37:41.690 line:0%
You can take it off then.

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:45.360 line:0%
I'm going to take it off then.

00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:24.260 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:38:55.930 --> 00:38:56.930 line:0%
Lu Chuichui.

00:38:57.600 --> 00:38:58.510 line:0%
Today,

00:38:59.080 --> 00:39:00.680 line:0%
I have shown you my true face.

00:39:01.620 --> 00:39:03.550 line:0%
Whether you are frightened or not,

00:39:03.820 --> 00:39:05.710 line:0%
please keep this a secret for me.

00:39:06.150 --> 00:39:07.390 line:0%
Do not tell

00:39:08.380 --> 00:39:10.010 line:0%
anyone else about this.

00:39:19.020 --> 00:39:20.750 line:0%
Remember what you promised me.

00:39:21.760 --> 00:39:23.220 line:0%
Don't break your promise.

00:39:29.190 --> 00:39:30.070 line:0%
I trust you.

00:39:54.880 --> 00:39:56.480 line:0%
What are you thinking about?

00:39:57.880 --> 00:39:58.980 line:0%
Nothing.

00:39:59.640 --> 00:40:00.540 line:0%
Well...

00:40:00.680 --> 00:40:01.560 line:0%
Xing, look.

00:40:01.710 --> 00:40:06.390 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:40:02.520 --> 00:40:04.000 line:0%
So many beautiful ladies

00:40:04.000 --> 00:40:04.680 line:0%
and talented scholars

00:40:04.680 --> 00:40:07.010 line:0%
have come here to pray for a good marriage.

00:40:08.960 --> 00:40:09.760 line:0%
They're here.

00:40:13.480 --> 00:40:14.960 line:0%
What a coincidence!

00:40:18.970 --> 00:40:21.370 line:0%
You've come to pray for a good marriage too?

00:40:21.400 --> 00:40:22.200 line:0%
What?

00:40:22.200 --> 00:40:22.720 line:0%
Only you female officials

00:40:22.720 --> 00:40:24.200 line:0%
from the Ministry of Justice can come here,

00:40:24.200 --> 00:40:25.160 line:0%
but we,

00:40:25.160 --> 00:40:26.560 line:0%
constables, can't come?

00:40:26.720 --> 00:40:28.000 line:0%
Of course not.

00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:29.480 line:0%
I'm just marveling at

00:40:29.600 --> 00:40:30.930 line:0%
how wonderfully

00:40:30.960 --> 00:40:32.640 line:0%
the coincidence has worked out.

00:40:32.640 --> 00:40:33.980 line:0%
Right, Xing?

00:40:41.240 --> 00:40:42.290 line:0%
Stop talking.

00:40:42.560 --> 00:40:43.360 line:0%
Let's go.

00:40:43.490 --> 00:40:44.570 line:0%
Where to?

00:40:47.530 --> 00:40:50.410 line:0%
Didn't you say you're here to pray for a good marriage?

00:40:50.410 --> 00:40:51.200 line:0%
To...

00:40:53.200 --> 00:40:55.140 line:0%
I can't believe it, Nerd Jiang.

00:40:55.180 --> 00:40:56.850 line:0%
You came for that too?

00:41:01.580 --> 00:41:03.960 line:0%
Impressive, Nerd Jiang.

00:41:05.490 --> 00:41:06.560 line:0%
Alright.

00:41:06.590 --> 00:41:08.280 line:0%
You're not young anymore.

00:41:08.300 --> 00:41:10.280 line:0%
It's normal that you want

00:41:10.320 --> 00:41:11.540 line:0%
a beautiful wife in real life.

00:41:11.540 --> 00:41:13.210 line:0%
I, Lu Chuichui, will accompany you.

00:41:13.210 --> 00:41:14.540 line:0%
I'll go with you.

00:41:15.040 --> 00:41:15.840 line:0%
Xing,

00:41:15.860 --> 00:41:18.420 line:0%
have a good chat with Commander Xu.

00:41:18.550 --> 00:41:19.780 line:0%
I'll be right back.

00:41:20.360 --> 00:41:21.390 line:0%
Let's go.

00:41:23.930 --> 00:41:24.960 line:0%
Xing, you rarely come

00:41:24.960 --> 00:41:26.840 line:0%
to Mingsheng Temple for sightseeing, right?

00:41:26.840 --> 00:41:29.100 line:0%
How about taking a walk around together?

00:41:30.580 --> 00:41:31.530 line:0%
You guys go ahead.

00:41:31.530 --> 00:41:32.730 line:0%
Don't worry about me.

00:41:38.530 --> 00:41:42.380 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:41:46.280 --> 00:41:47.120 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:41:47.440 --> 00:41:49.500 line:0%
you must drink this bowl of medicine.

00:42:02.530 --> 00:42:04.970 line:0%
Praying for a good marriage at Mingsheng Temple.

00:42:04.970 --> 00:42:06.010 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:42:07.040 --> 00:42:08.040 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:42:10.780 --> 00:42:16.180 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:42:24.940 --> 00:42:26.040 line:0%
Xu.

00:42:27.400 --> 00:42:29.760 line:0%
Do you have something to tell me?

00:42:33.480 --> 00:42:34.280 line:0%
Xing,

00:42:34.760 --> 00:42:35.960 line:0%
that day, I overheard

00:42:35.960 --> 00:42:38.360 line:0%
Lu Chuichui talking about your marriage.

00:42:39.140 --> 00:42:40.620 line:0%
Is this a joke?

00:42:40.760 --> 00:42:42.480 line:0%
How can a woman propose a divorce?

00:42:42.480 --> 00:42:44.200 line:0%
Why can't they?

00:42:44.400 --> 00:42:45.560 line:0%
Don't forget this.

00:42:45.690 --> 00:42:47.360 line:0%
According to the law of Cang State,

00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:48.400 line:0%
if a husband and wife

00:42:48.400 --> 00:42:50.880 line:0%
are not harmonious and decide to divorce,

00:42:50.920 --> 00:42:52.180 line:0%
it's not a crime.

00:42:53.560 --> 00:42:54.690 line:0%
Besides,

00:42:54.800 --> 00:42:56.340 line:0%
they haven't...

00:42:56.620 --> 00:42:58.720 line:0%
haven't consummated their marriage.

00:42:58.720 --> 00:43:00.720 line:0%
They've already agreed to divorce.

00:43:00.800 --> 00:43:01.600 line:0%
Anyway,

00:43:01.640 --> 00:43:03.360 line:0%
I told her long ago

00:43:03.380 --> 00:43:05.200 line:0%
to find another good man.

00:43:05.430 --> 00:43:06.510 line:0%
It's just that

00:43:06.530 --> 00:43:07.950 line:0%
among you constables

00:43:08.040 --> 00:43:10.010 line:0%
and those from the Ministry of Justice,

00:43:10.010 --> 00:43:11.570 line:0%
no one is suitable,

00:43:11.590 --> 00:43:13.090 line:0%
except for Commander Xu.

00:43:17.160 --> 00:43:19.340 line:0%
One day, I'll tear

00:43:19.370 --> 00:43:21.010 line:0%
Lu Chuichui's mouth.